  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Whispers follow 'Specter' around Subchain City. Some say he's a ghost of a hatchling that never made it, brought back by the toxic sludge that permeates the Rubbers Roost. Others believe he's just got a knack for disappearing before the Drip hits the fan.",
